==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{term|sækja heim|sækja einhvern heim|to visit somebody|lang=is}}, from the {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|sækja heim||to visit; to attack someone|lang=non}}. Confer the Danish {{term|hjemsøge|lang=da}}.

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|heimsótti|heimsótt}}

# {{context|transitive|governs the accusative|lang=is}} to [[visit]], to [[pay a visit]]{{jump|is|visit|s}}

